                            <comment id="491425" author="cbordage" created="Mon, 16 Mar 2026 14:02:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I will have two patches to address this issue. The first patch will be pushed soon.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="492357" author="cbordage" created="Thu, 2 Apr 2026 22:11:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;FYI, the previous patch fixes only the old API. Another patch will be implemented for netlink.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="494302" author="gerrit" created="Sun, 10 May 2026 22:35:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&quot;Oleg Drokin &amp;lt;green@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&quot; merged in patch &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65055/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65055/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
